WEBVTT

37:00.286 --> 37:02.413
I don't want the Lannisters
to know I'm coming.

37:02.538 --> 37:04.040
Let me accompany you at least.

37:04.165 --> 37:07.168
The Kingsroad can be a dangerous place
for a woman alone.

37:11.047 --> 37:13.299
What about Bran?

37:15.009 --> 37:17.887
I have prayed to the Seven
for more than a month.

37:19.222 --> 37:22.475
Bran's life is in their hands now.
